gh!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Remember when we were writing and giving speeches in English class?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Camilla</span>: It was a nerve-wracking process!", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn5le13ob07re2img04.jpg", "time": "11000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I never had good ideas when I was writing a speech!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Camilla</span>: I worked until the last minute on every one of them!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I was shaking while I was standing in front of everyone!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Camilla</span>: I cried when I finished! I hated doing that stuff!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: You have to be confident and relaxed when you stand up and talk.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Camilla</span>: You have to be creative and have good ideas.", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn5le13ob07re2img05.jpg", "time": "30250", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I think good speakers can be leaders, too.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Camilla</span>: I thought we were getting our diplomas first.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: They changed the order. Last year it was different.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Camilla</span>: The chancellor looks impatient. He keeps checking his watch!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm very patient! It's so nice not to be working!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Camilla</span>: You're funny, Peter!", "id": 3}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le13ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le13ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "id": 1}]}]}